OL,3,GNEWSACity's indoor market to get #1.25m
OL,4,Aupgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city's indoor market is to get at
OL,7,Fleast #1.25m of external improvements,
OL,8,Fa council has announced.
OL,10,FThe works to the exterior of the Grade
OL,11,FII-listed Coventry Market will include
OL,12,Fglazing in the lower section to let
OL,13,Fmore light in, wider doorways and
OL,14,Fbetter links between businesses and
OL,15,Fpublic space.
OL,17,FCoventry City Council said planning
OL,18,Fpermission was also being sought to add
OL,19,Fnew lighting and illuminated signs, as
OL,20,Fwell as public art.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
