OL,3,GNEWSACity's indoor market to get #1.25m
OL,4,Aupgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Parker, Mayor of the West
OL,7,FMidlands, said the market had been "at
OL,8,Fthe heart of the city for generations",
OL,9,Fand he wanted to see it thriving for
OL,10,Fgenerations to come.
